# Azure Functions local settings — contains secrets, never commit
local.settings.json

# Build output
bin/
obj/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user

# Rider
.idea/

# Publish profiles and deployment artifacts — contain Azure resource names / subscription IDs
**/Properties/

# Markdown docs — keep only the public-facing README and the ADRs out of the ignore list
*.md
!README.md
!docs/adr/*.md
